		"name": "Mechanic Shop API",
		"description": "Endpoint tests for the Mechanic Shop API (customers, mechanics, service tickets).\n\nStart the server with `python app.py` from the project root, then run this collection top to bottom — the Customers and Mechanics create requests store the new ids into collection variables that the Service Tickets requests depend on.",
